# Measured against this engine (Docker 29.7.2, BuildKit) while closing audit M10f: a pattern
# here matches from the context root and `*` does not cross `/`, so `.env`, `*.pem` and
# `secrets/` exclude only the top level - a nested `sub/.env` or `sub/secrets/jwt_private.pem`
# was copied into the image regardless. Every secret- and cache-bearing pattern is therefore
# written twice, once bare and once with `**/`. Do not delete the `**/` lines as duplicates.
#
# Version control
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes

# Environment files
.env
.env.*
.env.local
.env.*.local
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Secrets and keys
secrets/
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.cert
*.pfx
*.p12
**/secrets/
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.crt
**/*.cert
**/*.pfx
**/*.p12

# Dependencies
node_modules/
**/node_modules/

# Build outputs
.next/
dist/
build/
**/dist/
**/build/

# Python artifacts
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
*.egg-info
**/*.egg-info/
**/*.egg-info
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.pyo

# Virtual environments
.venv/
venv/
env/
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/env/

# Test and cache directories
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
coverage.xml
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.cache/
.tox/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.cache/

# Logs
logs/
*.log
**/*.log

# OS-generated files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# IDE and editor files
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/

# AI Assistants & Dev Agent tooling
.claude/
.kilo/
.cursor/
.gemini/
.antigravity/
.system_generated/
scratch/

# Docker sandbox temporary workspaces
*apiweaver-sandbox*
apiweaver_sandbox/

# Documentation and non-essential files
Project-docs/
monitoring/
infra/terraform/
**/README.md
**/README.txt
**/*.md

# Local database files
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db
alembic.db
